# Environment variables for the Codraft website.
#
# For local development, copy this file to `.env`. Never commit `.env`.
#
# Every variable is declared in the `env.schema` of astro.config.ts, which
# validates it when the dev server or the build starts, and is documented here
# with a comment and an empty or example value.
#
# Phase 1 defines no variables. Phase 4 adds the transactional email
# (Scaleway), booking and Anthropic API settings.
